  "notes": "きゅっと is an onomatopoeia describing a quick, tight squeeze or grip. It's lighter than ぎゅっと.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ぎゅっと: tightly, firmly (stronger/longer squeeze)\n- きゅうっと: variant spelling with longer vowel\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- きゅっと締める: to tighten\n- きゅっと握る: to squeeze/grip",
